# Overview

:lead Rocci is a stack for building web applications using Roc. Rocci templates lets you write HTML templates for Roc web applications. Standalone Rocci applications allow bulding web applications with Roc and Datastar.

Example of a simple Rocci template:

```rocci
@component
Hello = |{ name }|
    <p>Hello, <strong>{name}</strong></p>
```

macOS and Linux development are tested in CI. There is no crates.io
package or installer yet; [build from this repository](/docs/install/).

